  ‖4 * w ^ 2 - a ^ 2‖ ^ 2 = (‖a‖ ^ 2 + 4 * ‖w‖ ^ 2) ^ 2 - 16 * (a * (starRingEnd ℂ) w).re ^ 2
BorceaVariance.choose_signed_critical_point (a w : ℂ) :
